	This is another of NetHack's cute little quirks.  What you drank
was a cursed potion of object detection.  This is generally not too bad,
unless there are mimics on the level.  If there are, they are instantly
teleported to your location (and they're not in a friendly mood).
	A very good way to die if you're not prepared! 
